Error: Jet.NonSwappableEffectContext: `Unsafe` is not a swappable effect and cannot be installed in `#Context`
  --> Tests/UI/context_effect_non_swappable_e0782.jet:5:14
    |
  5 |     #Context(Unsafe: NoopUnsafe{}) {
    |              ^^^^^^
 Why: Structural and non-swappable effects (`Unsafe`, `Panic`, `Mem.*`, `FFI.*`, `Meta.*`, or any `#Effect(swappable: false)` trait) represent language or machine guarantees that cannot be replaced or discharged by a local handler
 Fix: Remove `Unsafe: ...` from `#Context(...)` and declare or control `Unsafe` in the function's effect row
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.NonSwappableEffectContext
